{"title":"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 33","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_33&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If the number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/2/4821bef1583b2c97354f97e80940f15c079a0fa3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15!$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"21\" height=\"13\" />, that is, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/9/459315f620e1cd42609d2a1993d89ca4bfcb6bd1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15 \\cdot 14 \\cdot 13 \\dots 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"116\" height=\"13\" />, ends with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> zeros when given to the base <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> and ends with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/8/8189a5b5a0917b8c93350827be4038af1839139d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> zeros \nwhen given to the base <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/0/b00dd99f549ae866dcf128400b7e4a4edadc6ac2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k + h$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"42\" height=\"14\" /> equals: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/0/cf0614b8f9d05ab3a17fc39be4760d9441e90436.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 5 \\qquad  \\textbf{(B) }\\ 6 \\qquad  \\textbf{(C) }\\ 7 \\qquad  \\textbf{(D) }\\ 8 \\qquad  \\textbf{(E) }\\ 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"374\" height=\"17\" />  \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_33&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can use <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Legendre%27s_Formula\" title=\"Legendre&#39;s Formula\">Legendre's Formula</a> to find the number of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />s in base <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/0/3e0d7ca65804a10128b7f54b77fec8e41729fcfa.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\lfloor \\frac{15}{5} \\rfloor + \\lfloor \\frac{15}{25} \\rfloor = 3\\]\" width=\"128\" height=\"37\" />\nSo <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/1/9b1af1c7c5d4066da1885524ca89c83dd263ccef.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$h = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />.\nLikewise, we are looking for the number of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/a/32a35631e1e126934ead6d2af161e9d250827bbb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^2$\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" />s and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />s that divide <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/2/4821bef1583b2c97354f97e80940f15c079a0fa3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15!$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"21\" height=\"13\" />, so we use Legendre's again.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/8/378195d015eae6f05632ab620b62d19dd528df06.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\lfloor \\frac{15}{2} \\rfloor + \\lfloor \\frac{15}{4} \\rfloor + \\lfloor \\frac{15}{8} \\rfloor = 7 + 3 + 1 = 11\\]\" width=\"293\" height=\"38\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/a/10a0f48b6948282f2c4c840101c47a6aca96d1ba.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\lfloor \\frac{15}{3} \\rfloor + \\lfloor \\frac{15}{9} \\rfloor = 5 + 1 = 6\\]\" width=\"193\" height=\"38\" />\nThus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/5/8253805a3005e3f95a7f0139c72c84f545ba6f7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^6 \\vert 15!$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"19\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/0/e60aa24a52c780429acf07862403b40064b9936f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{11} \\vert 15! \\Rrightarrow (2^2)^5 \\vert 15!$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"144\" height=\"19\" />\nSo <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/b/94be282a752a4f13a21a13c8abbf7c6185434fa5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k = 5$\" width=\"43\" height=\"12\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/6/1d64838f1ba3591b66415f6367a15d210f680cf2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5+3 = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"73\" height=\"14\" />, which corresponds to answer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/e/8de616f86c4a1dee1e38a5bc9da93b27b1790fa3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{\\textbf{(D)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"43\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~JustinLee2017\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_33&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME\" title=\"1965 AHSME\">1965 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1965 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1965\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_32\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 32\">Problem 32</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_34\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 34\">Problem 34</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1965 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1965_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" 